{"version":1,"content":"<p>周四報道稱，美國總統當勞·特朗普與SpaceX行政總裁埃隆·馬斯克進行了交談，並要求馬斯克解除對其「星鏈」衞星系統的限制。報道援引未具名美國官員的話稱，就該系統的速度仍被限制在每小時約100英裏的問題，特朗普向馬斯克表達了不滿。報道稱，美國和烏克蘭官員表示，該衞星系統周四運行正常。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583462.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:59:39.656647+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:51:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:57:55.887816+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:57:55.887816+00:00","content_hash":"7592b755db5e391f2fd8c14cdb262ed164bc0ca85ebaa596e7b02e502d954d47","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}